{"about_the_game":"Unprepared and helpless, you are taken to a dark place where a mysterious light hunts you. In this relentlessly terrifying survival horror game, you must use your wits to stay alive long enough to extinguish the light, or perish trying. But be warned: the light is crafty and observant, so this won't be an easy challenge. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nD.F.R.: The Light is a single-player, first-person survival horror game with a heavy emphasis on stealth. It doesn't rely on jump scares, but instead builds a sustained feeling of dread in the player with its unique &quot;reward/punishment&quot; game mechanics and increasingly aggressive behavioral artificial intelligence.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"41166058ba71e1e5e29fe25fa6c0af42f5368c78.jpg","localized_name":"VANQUISHED","name":"VANQUISHED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/747750/41166058ba71e1e5e29fe25fa6c0af42f5368c78.jpg"},{"icon":"15d5dd4ca053c69a23ef0bfa5eeb2b56b58defdf.jpg","localized_name":"HORROR MASTER","name":"HORROR MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/747750/15d5dd4ca053c69a23ef0bfa5eeb2b56b58defdf.jpg"},{"icon":"37f28429affa3ae6820854786113aeeaeb7d817f.jpg","localized_name":"HORROR ENTHUSIAST","name":"HORROR ENTHUSIAST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/747750/37f28429affa3ae6820854786113aeeaeb7d817f.jpg"},{"icon":"9b02f23aa4a9bcea2245158ea5176ba3f6232911.jpg","localized_name":"CROWN OF DEATH","name":"CROWN OF DEATH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/747750/9b02f23aa4a9bcea2245158ea5176ba3f6232911.jpg"},{"icon":"fc8ff665de964672555899bc4d82a4f14a839be4.jpg","localized_name":"ONE CANDLE","name":"ONE CANDLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/747750/fc8ff665de964672555899bc4d82a4f14a839be4.jpg"},{"icon":"33683c815bdb260f967a17bfb83d2fc85550ecbf.jpg","localized_name":"